  "translatedBlocks": 11,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eaf0117b517dc84",
      "translationZh": "我通过 Ollama 和 LM Studio 运行本地模型，并将它们与自定义系统脚本关联起来。我反复遇到的一个烦恼不是最初的工具调用，而是模型陷入循环时出现的重复重试，或执行序列中途发生的参数变更。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "270b87668bc1583c",
      "translationZh": "我构建了一个轻量级的 v0.1 Rust CLI / 库形式的关卡，其中本地模型仅充当不受信任的提议者：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf5867358ada899f",
      "translationZh": "可信签发方创建一份一次性授权凭证，将其绑定到操作 + 资源 + 载荷的 SHA-256。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cc42246e01faa45",
      "translationZh": "智能体提交其工具请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2933a9c82927d47c",
      "translationZh": "第一个匹配的请求会被执行，并以原子方式作废磁盘上的授权凭证（O_EXCL / create_new）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7baf918577cfe9f",
      "translationZh": "任何重放或载荷变更都会立即得到 DENY。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123ac59ba127fff3",
      "translationZh": "披露：这是我自己的开源项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00715b7275896ec3",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/trencinodin-stack/arcstone-mcp-sidecar",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "714d51d71968cb5f",
      "translationZh": "注意：目前这只是一个本地 CLI 工具和库函数（execute_request()），并不是完整的 stdio MCP 代理服务器。你需要在工具处理函数中直接调用它，然后再执行文件修改或 shell 脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5488376532cee8bb",
      "translationZh": "很好奇，其他运行本地智能体的人会采用哪些模式来捕捉重复执行循环或未经授权的重试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f48b1f4ae800b41",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/AdmissibilityScience 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
